      "writtenOn": "2025-12-01T19:42:53Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the explanation. A general practice in libaom is to keep all speed features (for encoder speed or decoder speed) in one place (speed_features file), so people don\u0027t have to look at every file to know what is going on. We have ALLINTRA features. If you want to enable it for all speeds, just enable it at speed 0 for example. We also have qindex based speed feature (av1_set_speed_features_qindex_dependent()) if that is a proper place for it.",
      "parentUuid": "96c5b9d1_2da7a1ca",
      "revId": "36944b5779f8f174401a50d47cc57487d285d744",
      "serverId": "e5514cf8-2d6e-3e29-adb4-24cd6dde4bf0"
    },
